      "The source gives the spatial probe grid and nominal velocity. Original trigger offsets, propagation delays and position-specific sound envelopes are unavailable.",
      "The delivered vibrotactile waveform, actuator acceleration and synchronized gamepad latency require calibration. The 100 ms pulse is the motor command duration.",
